<title>UK: Sumitomo Realty sets 20 billion yen Nov 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Realty sets 20 billion yen Nov 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUMITOMO REALTY AND DEVELOPMENT CO</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    05.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.775   PAY DATE S  20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.0     S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
